WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.334 --> 00:00:10.413
Mommy and Daddy take turns reading books to us.

2
00:00:10.414 --> 00:00:13.587
It was Daddy's turn tonight.

3
00:00:13.588 --> 00:00:15.881
Dad: Did you choose the book?

4
00:00:15.882 --> 00:00:20.090
Bada: Yes. I would like this book tonight.

5
00:00:20.091 --> 00:00:23.739
Dad: Okay. Let's read this storybook.

6
00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:25.797
Do you know what it's about?

7
00:00:25.798 --> 00:00:27.976
Bada: I'm not sure.

8
00:00:27.977 --> 00:00:30.510
Something about a snail?

9
00:00:30.511 --> 00:00:35.847
Dad: That's right. It's about a snail with a big house.

10
00:00:35.848 --> 00:00:39.555
Bada: Hmm. That sounds interesting.

11
00:00:39.556 --> 00:00:42.590
Dad: Your sister loved this book.

12
00:00:42.591 --> 00:00:44.109
Bada: Come on, Dad.

13
00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:46.547
Please read it to me.

14
00:00:46.548 --> 00:00:48.563
Dad: Here we go.

15
00:00:48.564 --> 00:00:51.920
Bada is usually wild and active.

16
00:00:51.921 --> 00:00:58.307
However, when it comes to reading, he becomes such a good boy.
